# Database schema

- **Postgres only** (`DATABASE_URL`). Tests use PGlite (`NODE_ENV=test`).
- **One domain per file** under `src/db/schema/` (e.g. `auth.ts`). Do not dump unrelated tables into one mega-schema.
- **Column helpers** in `columns.ts` (e.g. `timestampColumn`).
- **Relations** in `relations.ts`, separate from table definitions.
- Re-export from `schema/index.ts`; keep `authSchema` for Better Auth adapter.
- **Repositories** belong in `src/modules/<feature>/repository.ts`, not under `src/db/`.

```ts
// ✅ GOOD — new domain file
// src/db/schema/notes.ts → export from index.ts; relations in relations.ts

// ❌ BAD — add note tables into auth.ts or invent src/db/repository/
```
